---
title: SEQ-06 — Permanent account deletion (UC-06)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Reader or Teacher
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant IdP as Identity Provider
    User->>App: Choose Delete Account
    App-->>User: Explain deletion and ask for confirmation
    alt User cancels
        User-->>App: Cancel
        App-->>User: Keep account and data unchanged
    else User confirms
        User->>App: Confirm
        App->>Account: deleteAccount(user)
        alt Reader account
            Account->>DB: Delete Reader account, Sessions, Mistakes, Consents, Enrolments and received recipient rows
            Note over DB: Already delivered Messages for other Readers are unaffected
        else Teacher account
            Account->>DB: Delete Teacher account, Classes, join codes, Enrolments and sent Messages with recipients
            Note over DB: Readers' own Sessions are unaffected
        end
        Account->>DB: Commit deletion with anonymous DeletionLog(type, date)
        Note over DB: Log has no Account ID, identity subject, name or email
        DB-->>Account: Data erased and anonymous audit written
        Account->>IdP: Remove identity-provider account
        IdP-->>Account: Identity removed
        Account-->>App: Deletion complete
        App->>IdP: End login session
        IdP-->>App: Logged out
        App-->>User: Show login screen, no protected data accessible
    end
